-search-cancel-button]:hidden\" value=\"\"/></form></div><div class=\"ml-auto flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1 max-[359px]:gap-0.5 lg:ml-0 lg:gap-4\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Search products\" class=\"flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md text-ink transition-colors hover:bg-primary-soft hover:text-primary-strong lg:hidden\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg></button><a aria-label=\"Account\" class=\"relative flex h-11 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md px-3 text-caption font-medium text-ink transition-colors hover:bg-primary-soft hover:text-primary-strong lg:h-10 lg:px-2.5 hidden lg:flex\" href=\"/account\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-user size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M19 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H9a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg><span class=\"hidden xl:block\">Account</span></a><a aria-label=\"Wishlist\" class=\"relative flex h-11 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md px-3 text-caption font-medium text-ink transition-colors hover:bg-primary-soft hover:text-primary-strong lg:h-10 lg:px-2.5\" href=\"/wishlist\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"></path></svg><span class=\"hidden xl:block\">Wishlist</span></a><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Cart\" class=\"relative flex h-11 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md px-3 text-caption font-medium text-ink transition-colors hover:bg-primary-soft hover:text-primary-strong lg:h-10 lg:px-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shopping-cart size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"21\" r=\"1\"></circle><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"21\" r=\"1\"></circle><path d=\"M2.05 2.05h2l2.66 12.42a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.58h9.78a2 2 0 0 0 1.95-1.57l1.65-7.43H5.12\"></path></svg><span class=\"hidden sm:block\">Cart</span></button></div></div><nav aria-label=\"Product navigation\" class=\"hidden border-t border-line lg:block\"><div class=\"pm-shell\"><div class=\"relative flex h-12 items-center gap-1\"><div class=\"relative\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"pm-mega\" class=\"rounded-xs px-3 py-2 text-body-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:text-ink text-ink\">Shop All Boards</button></div><div><a aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"nav-menu-shop-white-boards\" class=\"relative block rounded-xs px-3 py-2 text-body-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:text-ink text-muted\" href=\"/shop/white-boards\">White Boards</a></div><div><a aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"nav-menu-shop-chalk-boards\" class=\"relative block rounded-xs px-3 py-2 text-body-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:text-ink text-muted\" href=\"/shop/chalk-boards\">Chalk Boards</a></div><div><a aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"nav-menu-shop-notice-boards\" class=\"relative block rounded-xs px-3 py-2 text-body-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:text-ink text-muted\" href=\"/shop/notice-boards\">Notice Boards</a></div><div><a aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"nav-menu-collections-ceramic-boards\" class=\"relative block rounded-xs px-3 py-2 text-body-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:text-ink text-muted\" href=\"/collections/ceramic-boards\">Ceramic Boards</a></div><div><a aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"nav-menu-shop-display-boards\" class=\"relative block rounded-xs px-3 py-2 text-body-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:text-ink text-muted\" href=\"/shop/display-boards\">Display Boards</a></div><div><a aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"nav-menu-shop-board-stands\" class=\"relative block rounded-xs px-3 py-2 text-body-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:text-ink text-muted\" href=\"/shop/board-stands\">Board Stands</a></div></div></div></nav></div></header><main id=\"main\" class=\"flex-1\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which products does Plusmark manufacture?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Plusmark manufactures white boards, chalk boards, notice boards, ceramic boards, magnetic boards, school benches and all types of board stands, along with clipboards, exam pads and specialty display boards.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the difference between the Metallic Premium, Eco Premium, Deluxe Standard and Eco Regular series?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Metallic Premium boards use heavy-duty aluminium anodized framing with Signature Dual-Tone Corners and are built for intensive daily institutional use. Eco Premium boards use premium-grade materials with ABS Dual-Tone Corners for regular institutional use. Deluxe Standard boards have Electroplated Chrome Corners and are dependable for everyday use. Eco Regular boards have a lightweight frame with standard plastic corners for light use and budget-friendly applications.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the difference between an HPL white board and a melamine white board?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Metallic Premium and Eco Premium white boards use a High Gloss Marker Grade HPL Sheet — an ultra-smooth, durable surface for effortless writing and easy erasing. Deluxe Standard and Eco Regular white boards use a High Gloss Melamine Writing Surface, which is smooth, easy to clean and suited to regular or lighter use.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Are Plusmark chalk boards glare-free?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Plusmark chalk boards use Chalk Grade HPL Sheet surfaces that are non-reflective and glare-free, with clear visibility from all angles. The Metallic Premium and Eco Premium series use Hardcore Chalk Grade HPL Sheet with enhanced scratch resistance.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Should I choose a magnetic board or a ceramic board?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Resin Coated Steel Magnetic Boards accept magnets, charts and holders and come in white (marker) and green (chalk) surfaces. Ceramic Steel Magnetic Boards use a ceramic steel / porcelain enamel steel surface that is hard and non-porous — suitable for continuous writing and frequent cleaning, for a very long product life.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What surfaces are available for notice boards?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Notice boards are available with 2 mm Blazer Cloth or Super Fine Velvet Cloth over soft, pin-friendly cores, in multiple colours. Cork and combination (white board + fabric) boards are also available.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which board sizes are available?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Standard sizes run from small 1 × 1 ft desk boards up to 8 × 4 ft classroom and lecture-hall boards. Metallic Premium and Deluxe Standard boards are made from 3 × 4 ft up to 8 × 4 ft; Eco Premium and Eco Regular boards from 1.5 × 2 ft up to 8 × 4 ft. Larger or non-standard sizes are made to order as per customer requirement. Just send an enquiry with the size you need.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I order a custom design or layout?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Dry Wipe Schedule Boards can be made in any design and any size to your sketch; fabric notice boards are available in your preferred fabric colour and layout; practice boards can have line marking as per school requirement; and acrylic folder display boards are made with folder size and quantity as required.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What do I need to share for a custom schedule board?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Please share the quantity of boards, the sizes and a sketch of the board. Sketches can be sent in CorelDRAW, Photoshop or Word format. If Plusmark prepares the design, additional charges apply.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does Plusmark supply across India?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Plusmark operates across India and supplies products nationwide to schools, colleges, coaching centres, offices, dealers, distributors, factories and government institutions.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do Plusmark products come with a warranty?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Plusmark provides warranty on all products it manufactures. Please confirm the warranty terms for your order with our authorized distributor or marketing executive.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Where is Plusmark located?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Plusmark Display System is located at Narolgam, Ahmedabad, Gujarat. The full address and map are on the Contact page.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What will freight cost and how long will delivery take?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Plusmark has not published a common freight rate or delivery estimate. Both depend on the order and destination and are confirmed when the invoice is raised.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What return window and refund timeline apply?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The return window, eligibility rules and refund timeline have not been signed off for this storefront. Confirm the terms with Plusmark before ordering.\"}}]}</script><section class=\"bg-page border-b border-line py-12 lg:py-16\"><div class=\"pm-shell flex flex-col gap-6\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><ol class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-1.5 gap-y-1 text-caption text-muted\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><a class=\"-my-2.5 inline-flex min-h-10 items-center rounded-xs py-2.5 transition-colors hover:text-ink hover:underline hover:decoration-line-strong hover:underline-offset-4\" href=\"/\">Home</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right size-3 text-hair-strong\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span aria-current=\"page\" class=\"text-ink\">FAQ</span></li></ol></nav><div class=\"grid gap-10\"><div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-4\"><h1 class=\"balance max-w-[24ch] font-display font-extrabold text-ink text-h1\">Questions about boards, sizes and supply</h1><p class=\"pretty max-w-reading text-body leading-relaxed text-muted\">Search the Plusmark FAQ by material, size, surface, delivery or returns. Where the business has not published an answer, the entry says so instead of filling the gap with a guessed policy.</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"faq-explorer\" class=\"scroll-mt-48 lg:scroll-mt-52 py-16 lg:py-24 border-b border-line bg-page\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-explorer-heading\"><div class=\"pm-shell\"><header class=\"mb-6 flex flex-col gap-3 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between md:gap-8 lg:mb-10\"><div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-2\"><h2 id=\"faq-explorer-heading\" class=\"balance max-w-[24ch] font-display font-extrabold text-ink text-h2\">Find an answer</h2></div></header><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5 rounded-sm border border-line bg-surface p-5\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 lg:flex-row lg:items-end lg:justify-between\"><div class=\"w-full lg:max-w-md\"><label for=\"faq-search\" class=\"text-caption font-medium text-ink\">Search the questions</label><div class=\"relative mt-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search pointer-events-none absolute left-3 top-1/2 size-4 -translate-y-1/2 text-muted\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg><input id=\"faq-search\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Size, magnetic, surface, warranty, delivery\" class=\"h-11 w-full rounded-xs border border-line-strong bg-surface pl-9 pr-3 text-body-sm text-ink placeholder:text-muted focus-visible:border-navy-deep\" value=\"\"/></div></div><p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"text-caption text-muted\">Showing 14 questions — 12 answered by Plusmark, 2 pending the desk.</p></div><div role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Filter by section\" class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\" class=\"min-h-11 rounded-xs border px-3.5 text-caption font-medium transition-colors border-primary bg-primary text-onprimary\">All sections</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"min-h-11 rounded-xs border px-3.5 text-caption font-medium transition-colors border-line-strong text-ink hover:bg-subtle/70\">Products &amp; Materials</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"min-h-11 rounded-xs border px-3.5 text-caption font-medium transition-colors border-line-strong text-ink hover:bg-subtle/70\">Sizes &amp; Customisation</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"min-h-11 rounded-xs border px-3.5 text-caption font-medium transition-colors border-line-strong text-ink hover:bg-subtle/70\">Supply &amp; Ordering</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"min-h-11 rounded-xs border px-3.5 text-caption font-medium transition-colors border-line-strong text-ink hover:bg-subtle/70\">Delivery &amp; policies</button></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2 border-t border-line pt-4\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-caption text-muted\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-xs border px-2 py-1 text-label font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.1em] border-primary/25 bg-primary-soft text-primary-strong\">As answered by Plusmark</span>taken from the FAQ published on plusmarkboards.com</span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-caption text-muted\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-xs border px-2 py-1 text-label font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.1em] border-dashed border-line-strong bg-transparent text-muted\">Awaiting the desk</span>the answer is not published yet — shown as a placeholder, never invented</span></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-12\"><section aria-labelledby=\"faq-section-products-materials\"><h2 id=\"faq-section-products-materials\" class=\"mb-4 font-display text-h3\">Products &amp; Materials</h2><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-line bg-surface px-5\"><h3><button id=\"_R_4ddbsnkpfdb_-faq-1-button\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"_R_4ddbsnkpfdb_-faq-1-panel\" class=\"group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-left\"><span class=\"font-display text-h4 font-semibold leading-snug transition-colors sm:text-h3 text-primary-strong\">Which products does Plusmark manufacture?</span><span class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"hidden text-caption text-muted md:inline\">As answered by Plusmark</span><span class=\"flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-colors border-primary bg-primary text-onprimary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-minus size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path></svg></span></span></button></h3><div id=\"_R_4ddbsnkpfdb_-faq-1-panel\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_4ddbsnkpfdb_-faq-1-button\" class=\"max-w-reading pb-6 pr-0 text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-muted sm:pr-14\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p>Plusmark manufactures white boards, chalk boards, notice boards, ceramic boards, magnetic boards, school benches and all types of board stands, along with clipboards, exam pads and specialty display boards.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-line bg-surface px-5\"><h3><button id=\"_R_4ddbsnkpfdb_-faq-2-button\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"_R_4ddbsnkpfdb_-faq-2-panel\" class=\"group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-left\"><span class=\"font-display text-h4 font-semibold leading-snug transition-colors sm:text-h3 text-ink\">What is the difference between the Metallic Premium, Eco Premium, Deluxe Standard and Eco Regular series?</span><span class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"hidden text-caption text-muted md:inline\">As answered by Plusmark</span><span class=\"flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-colors border-line bg-surface text-ink group-hover:border-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg></span></span></button></h3><div id=\"_R_4ddbsnkpfdb_-faq-2-panel\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_4ddbsnkpfdb_-faq-2-button\" hidden=\"\" class=\"max-w-reading pb-6 pr-0 text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-muted sm:pr-14\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p>Metallic Premium boards use heavy-duty aluminium anodized framing with Signature Dual-Tone Corners and are built for intensive daily institutional use. Eco Premium boards use premium-grade materials with ABS Dual-Tone Corners for regular institutional use. Deluxe Standard boards have Electroplated Chrome Corners and are dependable for everyday use. Eco Regular boards have a lightweight frame with standard plastic corners for light use and budget-friendly applications.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-line bg-surface px-5\"><h3><button id=\"_R_4ddbsnkpfdb_-faq-3-button\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"_R_4ddbsnkpfdb_-faq-3-panel\" class=\"group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-left\"><span class=\"font-display text-h4 font-semibold leading-snug transition-colors sm:text-h3 text-ink\">What is the difference between an HPL white board and a melamine white board?</span><span class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"hidden text-caption text-muted md:inline\">As answered by Plusmark</span><span class=\"flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-colors border-line bg-surface text-ink group-hover:border-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg></span></span></button></h3><div id=\"_R_4ddbsnkpfdb_-faq-3-panel\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_4ddbsnkpfdb_-faq-3-button\" hidden=\"\" class=\"max-w-reading pb-6 pr-0 text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-muted sm:pr-14\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p>Metallic Premium and Eco Premium white boards use a High Gloss Marker Grade HPL Sheet — an ultra-smooth, durable surface for effortless writing and easy erasing. Deluxe Standard and Eco Regular white boards use a High Gloss Melamine Writing Surface, which is smooth, easy to clean and suited to regular or lighter use.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-line bg-surface px-5\"><h3><button id=\"_R_4ddbsnkpfdb_-faq-4-button\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"_R_4ddbsnkpfdb_-faq-4-panel\" class=\"group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-left\"><span class=\"font-display text-h4 font-semibold leading-snug transition-colors sm:text-h3 text-ink\">Are Plusmark chalk boards glare-free?</span><span class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"hidden text-caption text-muted md:inline\">As answered by Plusmark</span><span class=\"flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-colors border-line bg-surface text-ink group-hover:border-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg></span></span></button></h3><div id=\"_R_4ddbsnkpfdb_-faq-4-panel\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_4ddbsnkpfdb_-faq-4-button\" hidden=\"\" class=\"max-w-reading pb-6 pr-0 text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-muted sm:pr-14\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p>Yes. Plusmark chalk boards use Chalk Grade HPL Sheet surfaces that are non-reflective and glare-free, with clear visibility from all angles. The Metallic Premium and Eco Premium series use Hardcore Chalk Grade HPL Sheet with enhanced scratch resistance.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-line bg-surface px-5\"><h3><button id=\"_R_4ddbsnkpfdb_-faq-5-button\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"_R_4ddbsnkpfdb_-faq-5-panel\" class=\"group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-left\"><span class=\"font-display text-h4 font-semibold leading-snug transition-colors sm:text-h3 text-ink\">Should I choose a magnetic board or a ceramic board?</span><span class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"hidden text-caption text-muted md:inline\">As answered by Plusmark</span><span class=\"flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-colors border-line bg-surface text-ink group-hover:border-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg></span></span></button></h3><div id=\"_R_4ddbsnkpfdb_-faq-5-panel\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_4ddbsnkpfdb_-faq-5-button\" hidden=\"\" class=\"max-w-reading pb-6 pr-0 text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-muted sm:pr-14\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p>Resin Coated Steel Magnetic Boards accept magnets, charts and holders and come in white (marker) and green (chalk) surfaces. Ceramic Steel Magnetic Boards use a ceramic steel / porcelain enamel steel surface that is hard and non-porous — suitable for continuous writing and frequent cleaning, for a very long product life.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-line bg-surface px-5\"><h3><button id=\"_R_4ddbsnkpfdb_-faq-6-button\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"_R_4ddbsnkpfdb_-faq-6-panel\" class=\"group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-left\"><span class=\"font-display text-h4 font-semibold leading-snug transition-colors sm:text-h3 text-ink\">What surfaces are available for notice boards?</span><span class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"hidden text-caption text-muted md:inline\">As answered by Plusmark</span><span class=\"flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-colors border-line bg-surface text-ink group-hover:border-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg></span></span></button></h3><div id=\"_R_4ddbsnkpfdb_-faq-6-panel\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_4ddbsnkpfdb_-faq-6-button\" hidden=\"\" class=\"max-w-reading pb-6 pr-0 text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-muted sm:pr-14\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p>Notice boards are available with 2 mm Blazer Cloth or Super Fine Velvet Cloth over soft, pin-friendly cores, in multiple colours. Cork and combination (white board + fabric) boards are also available.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section aria-labelledby=\"faq-section-sizes-customisation\"><h2 id=\"faq-section-sizes-customisation\" class=\"mb-4 font-display text-h3\">Sizes &amp; Customisation</h2><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-line bg-surface px-5\"><h3><button id=\"_R_4ldbsnkpfdb_-faq-7-button\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"_R_4ldbsnkpfdb_-faq-7-panel\" class=\"group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-left\"><span class=\"font-display text-h4 font-semibold leading-snug transition-colors sm:text-h3 text-primary-strong\">Which board sizes are available?</span><span class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"hidden text-caption text-muted md:inline\">As answered by Plusmark</span><span class=\"flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-colors border-primary bg-primary text-onprimary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-minus size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path></svg></span></span></button></h3><div id=\"_R_4ldbsnkpfdb_-faq-7-panel\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_4ldbsnkpfdb_-faq-7-button\" class=\"max-w-reading pb-6 pr-0 text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-muted sm:pr-14\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p>Standard sizes run from small 1 × 1 ft desk boards up to 8 × 4 ft classroom and lecture-hall boards. Metallic Premium and Deluxe Standard boards are made from 3 × 4 ft up to 8 × 4 ft; Eco Premium and Eco Regular boards from 1.5 × 2 ft up to 8 × 4 ft. Larger or non-standard sizes are made to order as per customer requirement. Just send an enquiry with the size you need.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-line bg-surface px-5\"><h3><button id=\"_R_4ldbsnkpfdb_-faq-8-button\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"_R_4ldbsnkpfdb_-faq-8-panel\" class=\"group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-left\"><span class=\"font-display text-h4 font-semibold leading-snug transition-colors sm:text-h3 text-ink\">Can I order a custom design or layout?</span><span class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"hidden text-caption text-muted md:inline\">As answered by Plusmark</span><span class=\"flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-colors border-line bg-surface text-ink group-hover:border-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg></span></span></button></h3><div id=\"_R_4ldbsnkpfdb_-faq-8-panel\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_4ldbsnkpfdb_-faq-8-button\" hidden=\"\" class=\"max-w-reading pb-6 pr-0 text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-muted sm:pr-14\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p>Yes. Dry Wipe Schedule Boards can be made in any design and any size to your sketch; fabric notice boards are available in your preferred fabric colour and layout; practice boards can have line marking as per school requirement; and acrylic folder display boards are made with folder size and quantity as required.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-line bg-surface px-5\"><h3><button id=\"_R_4ldbsnkpfdb_-faq-9-button\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"_R_4ldbsnkpfdb_-faq-9-panel\" class=\"group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-left\"><span class=\"font-display text-h4 font-semibold leading-snug transition-colors sm:text-h3 text-ink\">What do I need to share for a custom schedule board?</span><span class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"hidden text-caption text-muted md:inline\">As answered by Plusmark</span><span class=\"flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-colors border-line bg-surface text-ink group-hover:border-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg></span></span></button></h3><div id=\"_R_4ldbsnkpfdb_-faq-9-panel\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_4ldbsnkpfdb_-faq-9-button\" hidden=\"\" class=\"max-w-reading pb-6 pr-0 text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-muted sm:pr-14\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p>Please share the quantity of boards, the sizes and a sketch of the board. Sketches can be sent in CorelDRAW, Photoshop or Word format. If Plusmark prepares the design, additional charges apply.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section aria-labelledby=\"faq-section-supply-ordering\"><h2 id=\"faq-section-supply-ordering\" class=\"mb-4 font-display text-h3\">Supply &amp; Ordering</h2><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-line bg-surface px-5\"><h3><button id=\"_R_4tdbsnkpfdb_-faq-10-button\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"_R_4tdbsnkpfdb_-faq-10-panel\" class=\"group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-left\"><span class=\"font-display text-h4 font-semibold leading-snug transition-colors sm:text-h3 text-primary-strong\">Does Plusmark supply across India?</span><span class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"hidden text-caption text-muted md:inline\">As answered by Plusmark</span><span class=\"flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-colors border-primary bg-primary text-onprimary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-minus size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path></svg></span></span></button></h3><div id=\"_R_4tdbsnkpfdb_-faq-10-panel\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_4tdbsnkpfdb_-faq-10-button\" class=\"max-w-reading pb-6 pr-0 text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-muted sm:pr-14\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p>Yes. Plusmark operates across India and supplies products nationwide to schools, colleges, coaching centres, offices, dealers, distributors, factories and government institutions.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-line bg-surface px-5\"><h3><button id=\"_R_4tdbsnkpfdb_-faq-11-button\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"_R_4tdbsnkpfdb_-faq-11-panel\" class=\"group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-left\"><span class=\"font-display text-h4 font-semibold leading-snug transition-colors sm:text-h3 text-ink\">Do Plusmark products come with a warranty?</span><span class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"hidden text-caption text-muted md:inline\">As answered by Plusmark</span><span class=\"flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-colors border-line bg-surface text-ink group-hover:border-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg></span></span></button></h3><div id=\"_R_4tdbsnkpfdb_-faq-11-panel\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_4tdbsnkpfdb_-faq-11-button\" hidden=\"\" class=\"max-w-reading pb-6 pr-0 text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-muted sm:pr-14\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p>Plusmark provides warranty on all products it manufactures. Please confirm the warranty terms for your order with our authorized distributor or marketing executive.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-line bg-surface px-5\"><h3><button id=\"_R_4tdbsnkpfdb_-faq-12-button\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"_R_4tdbsnkpfdb_-faq-12-panel\" class=\"group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-left\"><span class=\"font-display text-h4 font-semibold leading-snug transition-colors sm:text-h3 text-ink\">Where is Plusmark located?</span><span class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"hidden text-caption text-muted md:inline\">As answered by Plusmark</span><span class=\"flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-colors border-line bg-surface text-ink group-hover:border-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg></span></span></button></h3><div id=\"_R_4tdbsnkpfdb_-faq-12-panel\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_4tdbsnkpfdb_-faq-12-button\" hidden=\"\" class=\"max-w-reading pb-6 pr-0 text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-muted sm:pr-14\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p>Plusmark Display System is located at Narolgam, Ahmedabad, Gujarat. The full address and map are on the Contact page.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section aria-labelledby=\"faq-section-delivery-policies\"><h2 id=\"faq-section-delivery-policies\" class=\"mb-4 font-display text-h3\">Delivery &amp; policies</h2><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-line bg-surface px-5\"><h3><button id=\"_R_55dbsnkpfdb_-pending-freight-button\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"_R_55dbsnkpfdb_-pending-freight-panel\" class=\"group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-left\"><span class=\"font-display text-h4 font-semibold leading-snug transition-colors sm:text-h3 text-primary-strong\">What will freight cost and how long will delivery take?</span><span class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"hidden text-caption text-muted md:inline\">Awaiting the desk</span><span class=\"flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-colors border-primary bg-primary text-onprimary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-minus size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path></svg></span></span></button></h3><div id=\"_R_55dbsnkpfdb_-pending-freight-panel\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_55dbsnkpfdb_-pending-freight-button\" class=\"max-w-reading pb-6 pr-0 text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-muted sm:pr-14\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p>Plusmark has not published a common freight rate or delivery estimate. Both depend on the order and destination and are confirmed when the invoice is raised.</p><p class=\"rounded-sm border border-dashed border-graphite/40 bg-subtle/40 px-3 py-2 text-caption text-muted\">Configurable answer — Plusmark has not published this yet. The desk handling your order confirms it; see <a class=\"underline decoration-line-strong underline-offset-4\" href=\"/contact\">contact &amp; support</a>.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-line bg-surface px-5\"><h3><button id=\"_R_55dbsnkpfdb_-pending-returns-button\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"_R_55dbsnkpfdb_-pending-returns-panel\" class=\"group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-left\"><span class=\"font-display text-h4 font-semibold leading-snug transition-colors sm:text-h3 text-ink\">What return window and refund timeline apply?</span><span class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"hidden text-caption text-muted md:inline\">Awaiting the desk</span><span class=\"flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-colors border-line bg-surface text-ink group-hover:border-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg></span></span></button></h3><div id=\"_R_55dbsnkpfdb_-pending-returns-panel\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_55dbsnkpfdb_-pending-returns-button\" hidden=\"\" class=\"max-w-reading pb-6 pr-0 text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-muted sm:pr-14\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p>The return window, eligibility rules and refund timeline have not been signed off for this storefront. Confirm the terms with Plusmark before ordering.</p><p class=\"rounded-sm border border-dashed border-graphite/40 bg-subtle/40 px-3 py-2 text-caption text-muted\">Configurable answer — Plusmark has not published this yet. The desk handling your order confirms it; see <a class=\"underline decoration-line-strong underline-offset-4\" href=\"/contact\">contact &amp; support</a>.</p></div></div></div></div></section></div></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"mt-10 bg-shell text-shell-on md:mt-16\"><div class=\"pm-shell py-9 md:py-14 lg:py-16\"><div class=\"grid gap-7 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.35fr_1fr_1fr_1fr] lg:gap-12\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1\"><a class=\"w-fit rounded-xs\" aria-label=\"Plusmark home\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Plusmark\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1304\" height=\"261\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-10 w-auto md:h-12\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/plusmark/brand/plusmark-white.png\"/></a><p class=\"max-w-sm text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-shell-on/72\">Writing boards, chalk boards, notice boards and display systems made in Ahmedabad, shipped across India. Order a single board online.</p><p class=\"text-caption font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-shell-on/55\">Established 2015</p><a href=\"https://plusmarkboards.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-1.5 text-body-sm text-shell-on/80 underline decoration-shell-on/30 underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-shell-on hover:decoration-shell-on\">plusmarkboards.com<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" he