ion-colors hover:text-shell-on\",\"children\":\"Chalk Boards\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"double-sided-boards\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L9\",null,{\"href\":\"/shop/double-sided-boards\",\"className\":\"flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-xs text-body-sm text-shell-on/72 transition-colors hover:text-shell-on\",\"children\":\"Double-Sided Boards\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"notice-boards\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L9\",null,{\"href\":\"/shop/notice-boards\",\"className\":\"flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-xs text-body-sm text-shell-on/72 transition-colors hover:text-shell-on\",\"children\":\"Notice Boards\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"acrylic-door-cover-notice-boards\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L9\",null,{\"href\":\"/shop/acrylic-door-cover-notice-boards\",\"className\":\"flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-xs text-body-sm text-shell-on/72 transition-colors hover:text-shell-on\",\"children\":\"Acrylic Door Cover Notice Boards\"}]}],\"$L15\",\"$L16\"],\"$L17\"]}]}]]}],\"$L18\",\"$L19\",\"$L1a\"]}],\"$L1b\"]}]}],\"$L1c\",\"$L1d\"]}]\ne:[\"$\",\"$L1e\",null,{}]\nf:[\"$\",\"$L1f\",null,{}]\n10:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"error\":\"$undefined\",\"errorStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"errorScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{}],\"templateStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"templateScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"notFound\":\"$undefined\",\"forbidden\":\"$undefined\",\"unauthorized\":\"$undefined\"}]]}]\n20:T1485,{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which products does Plusmark manufacture?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Plusmark manufactures white boards, chalk boards, notice boards, ceramic boards, magnetic boards, school benches and all types of board stands, along with clipboards, exam pads and specialty display boards.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the difference between the Metallic Premium, Eco Premium, Deluxe Standard and Eco Regular series?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Metallic Premium boards use heavy-duty aluminium anodized framing with Signature Dual-Tone Corners and are built for intensive daily institutional use. Eco Premium boards use premium-grade materials with ABS Dual-Tone Corners for regular institutional use. Deluxe Standard boards have Electroplated Chrome Corners and are dependable for everyday use. Eco Regular boards have a lightweight frame with standard plastic corners for light use and budget-friendly applications.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the difference between an HPL white board and a melamine white board?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Metallic Premium and Eco Premium white boards use a High Gloss Marker Grade HPL Sheet — an ultra-smooth, durable surface for effortless writing and easy erasing. Deluxe Standard and Eco Regular white boards use a High Gloss Melamine Writing Surface, which is smooth, easy to clean and suited to regular or lighter use.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Are Plusmark chalk boards glare-free?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Plusmark chalk boards use Chalk Grade HPL Sheet surfaces that are non-reflective and glare-free, with clear visibility from all angles. The Metallic Premium and Eco Premium series use Hardcore Chalk Grade HPL Sheet with enhanced scratch resistance.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Should I choose a magnetic board or a ceramic board?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Resin Coated Steel Magnetic Boards accept magnets, charts and holders and come in white (marker) and green (chalk) surfaces. Ceramic Steel Magnetic Boards use a ceramic steel / porcelain enamel steel surface that is hard and non-porous — suitable for continuous writing and frequent cleaning, for a very long product life.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What surfaces are available for notice boards?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Notice boards are available with 2 mm Blazer Cloth or Super Fine Velvet Cloth over soft, pin-friendly cores, in multiple colours. Cork and combination (white board + fabric) boards are also available.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which board sizes are available?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Standard sizes run from small 1 × 1 ft desk boards up to 8 × 4 ft classroom and lecture-hall boards. Metallic Premium and Deluxe Standard boards are made from 3 × 4 ft up to 8 × 4 ft; Eco Premium and Eco Regular boards from 1.5 × 2 ft up to 8 × 4 ft. Larger or non-standard sizes are made to order as per customer requirement. Just send an enquiry with the size you need.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I order a custom design or layout?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Dry Wipe Schedule Boards can be made in any design and any size to your sketch; fabric notice boards are available in your preferred fabric colour and layout; practice boards can have line marking as per school requirement; and acrylic folder display boards are made with folder size and quantity as required.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What do I need to share for a custom schedule board?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Please share the quantity of boards, the sizes and a sketch of the board. Sketches can be sent in CorelDRAW, Photoshop or Word format. If Plusmark prepares the design, additional charges apply.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does Plusmark supply across India?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Plusmark operates across India and supplies products nationwide to schools, colleges, coaching centres, offices, dealers, distributors, factories and government institutions.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do Plusmark products come with a warranty?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Plusmark provides warranty on all products it manufactures. Please confirm the warranty terms for your order with our authorized distributor or marketing executive.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Where is Plusmark located?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Plusmark Display System is located at Narolgam, Ahmedabad, Gujarat. The full address and map are on the Contact page.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What will freight cost and how long will delivery take?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Plusmark has not published a common freight rate or delivery estimate. Both depend on the order and destination and are confirmed when the invoice is raised.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What return window and refund timeline apply?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The return window, eligibility rules and refund timeline have not been signed off for this storefront. Confirm the terms with Plusmark before ordering.\"}}]}11:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$20\"}}],\"$L21\",\"$L22\"],null,\"$L23\"]}]\n12:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[[\"$\",\"$L24\",null,{\"children\":\"$L25\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",null,{\"name\":\"next-size-adjust\",\"content\":\"\"}]],[\"$\",\"$L26\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$27\",null,{\"fallback\":null,\"children\":\"$L28\"}]}]}]]}]\n2c:I[76891,[\"297\",\"static/chunks/297-f56ae2421d6e7c3e.js\",\"9451\",\"static/chunks/app/(storefront)/faq/page-52b83689c2c94528.js\"],\"FaqExplorer\"]\n2d:I[24431,[],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n2f:I[15278,[],\"AsyncMetadataOutlet\"]\n15:[\"$\",\"li\",\"specialty-boards\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L9\",null,{\"href\":\"/shop/specialty-boards\",\"className\":\"flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-xs text-body-sm text-shell-on/72 transition-colors hover:text-shell-on\",\"children\":\"Specialty Display Boards\"}]}]\n16:[\"$\",